WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:02.002
Hmph.

00:02.002 --> 00:05.464
Hey!! Haruka!!

00:05.464 --> 00:08.008
I-it's a ghost!

00:08.926 --> 00:10.886
Good grief...

00:10.886 --> 00:14.890
M-Miss... Class Rep...?

00:15.140 --> 00:16.642
That's not my name!

00:16.642 --> 00:18.644
We've already known
each other since first grade!

00:18.644 --> 00:20.646
Whoa, sorry!

00:20.646 --> 00:22.856
Over here!

00:22.856 --> 00:24.608
Slow down...

00:26.235 --> 00:28.320
You're going too fast, Class Rep.

00:29.279 --> 00:31.573
We finally caught up...

00:31.573 --> 00:33.742
All this running makes me all sweaty...

00:33.742 --> 00:35.994
It's the girls from my class...

00:35.994 --> 00:38.539
So other than the gyarus,
they're all together.

00:39.665 --> 00:43.919
Haruka, did something happen
to Shimazaki and her friends?

00:43.919 --> 00:44.419
(Under Servitude)

00:44.419 --> 00:47.020
(Under Servitude)
They look a little weird...

00:47.020 --> 00:47.047
They look a little weird...

00:47.047 --> 00:48.840
Stare...

00:48.840 --> 00:51.051
H-how do I explain this to her?

00:51.051 --> 00:53.845
Lend us your strength!

00:53.845 --> 00:55.222
Okay...?

00:55.222 --> 00:55.764
(Servitude)

00:56.807 --> 01:00.978
If anything, I want someone
to explain it to me myself!

01:01.603 --> 01:03.981
♪Good Luck lies in odd numbers♪

01:03.981 --> 01:05.399
♪Good Luck♪

01:06.483 --> 01:15.158
(Loner Life in Another World)

01:16.535 --> 01:19.121
♪Shutting in my room
Makes me invincible on Mondays♪

01:19.121 --> 01:21.582
♪A single step outside
And it's trouble all over the place♪

01:21.582 --> 01:24.126
♪Someone fires a flare signaling a mayday♪

01:24.126 --> 01:26.587
♪I wish I could pretend I didn't hear it♪

01:26.587 --> 01:29.089
♪Enough with fair fights♪

01:29.089 --> 01:31.592
♪First come first serve is an illusion♪

01:31.592 --> 01:33.343
♪Leave everything to the dice♪

01:33.343 --> 01:36.013
♪But I'm bad with my rolls♪

01:36.680 --> 01:39.182
♪See, it may not be a clean cut♪

01:39.182 --> 01:41.727
♪But surprisingly
You're not just some leftover♪

01:41.727 --> 01:44.062
♪They have something that I don't?♪

01:44.062 --> 01:47.357
♪That's nonsense, I won't greed over that♪

01:48.233 --> 01:51.278
♪People decide who's a loner
And who is worthless♪

01:51.278 --> 01:53.905
♪Hold it right there young boy
You have some free time, right?♪

01:53.905 --> 01:55.991
♪Don't you just hate crowds?♪

01:55.991 --> 01:59.077
♪If you're bored, why not try a gamble?♪

01:59.077 --> 02:01.955
♪Manage the botches and luck then dance♪

02:01.955 --> 02:04.458
♪Not really into failing and falling♪

02:04.458 --> 02:06.960
♪Good Luck lies in odd numbers♪

02:06.960 --> 02:10.005
♪Doesn't cheating count as a skill?♪

02:19.973 --> 02:27.689
♪Good Luck lies in odd numbers♪

02:27.689 --> 02:28.857
♪Good Luck♪

02:34.800 --> 02:34.882
(Episode 3 Living with the Girls)

02:34.882 --> 02:36.359
(Episode 3 Living with the Girls)
They're serving you?

02:36.359 --> 02:38.158
(Episode 3 Living with the Girls)

02:38.158 --> 02:39.409
Yeah...

02:40.090 --> 02:40.118
(Nagging)

02:40.118 --> 02:45.374
(Nagging)
Why did you do that?! That's a skill
you use on monsters, not people!

02:45.374 --> 02:50.060
(Nagging)
I mean, it just activated on its own...
I don't know how it works either...

02:50.060 --> 02:50.087
I mean, it just activated on its own...
I don't know how it works either...

02:55.092 --> 02:57.260
Stare...

02:57.260 --> 02:59.346
The girls are giving me
the sharpest glares!

02:59.346 --> 03:02.099
So cold!
Someone must be using ice magic!

03:04.851 --> 03:06.687
All right, bye then!

03:06.687 --> 03:07.830
Hold it!

03:07.830 --> 03:08.397
(Why?! Hold it!)
Hold it!

03:08.397 --> 03:10.250
(Why?! Hold it!)
Why are you going home?!

03:10.250 --> 03:10.899
(Why?!) (Gyaa!) (Shouting) (Hold it!)

03:10.899 --> 03:15.278
Why am I not allowed to go home?
I'm a shut-in loner, you know?

03:15.278 --> 03:15.750
(Why?!) (Gyaa!) (Shouting) (Hold it!)

03:16.446 --> 03:18.740
Shimazaki, are you all right?

03:21.284 --> 03:22.619
Yeah.

03:22.619 --> 03:24.579
Oh, thank goodness!

03:25.956 --> 03:28.375
I know it's pointless
to ask you, Haruka,

03:28.375 --> 03:31.586
so I will be asking Shimazaki
and her friends about what happened.

03:31.586 --> 03:33.046
'Kay...

03:33.046 --> 03:34.756
You better not go anywhere!
Stay put!

03:37.426 --> 03:39.177
I see.

03:39.177 --> 03:41.680
- Must've been rough.
- It is.

03:42.305 --> 03:45.517
Well, I'm used to being left out alone.

03:45.517 --> 03:49.312
That said, I might as well use this time
to practice expanding my home base.

03:50.647 --> 03:52.733
Maybe I could make
a basement or something.

03:52.733 --> 03:55.110
Hey, this seems to be going well!

03:55.110 --> 03:58.447
If I focus my magic more into it...

04:05.829 --> 04:08.790
How did you get stuck
in the ground?!

04:08.790 --> 04:12.711
Didn't I tell you to stay put?

04:12.711 --> 04:14.629
W-well, I was bored...

04:14.629 --> 04:17.883
What are you, a cat stuck between things?

04:18.952 --> 04:21.329
Shimazaki told me
about what happened.

04:22.220 --> 04:24.890
You mean Gyaru Leader?

04:25.432 --> 04:31.146
Haruka, you were just trying to help
Shimazaki and everyone else, right?

04:31.938 --> 04:35.901
Did I? I don't remember
ever saying anything like that...

04:35.901 --> 04:38.111
Thank you so much!

04:38.111 --> 04:39.362
Thank you!

04:39.362 --> 04:41.531
O-oh, sure...

04:41.531 --> 04:43.867
So, uh, can I go home now?

04:44.117 --> 04:45.869
Why would you say that now?!

04:45.869 --> 04:47.871
I thought you were going to help!

04:47.871 --> 04:48.872
Eep!

04:48.872 --> 04:50.123
Come on!

04:50.123 --> 04:51.124
Will you or won't you?!

04:51.124 --> 04:52.375
Make it clear!

04:53.084 --> 04:56.087
Go home? What do you mean?

04:56.087 --> 04:58.840
Huh? Well, I have a home here.

04:58.840 --> 05:03.136
How come you have a home in this world?!
Are you born here?!

05:03.136 --> 05:06.348
I had free time... So I just made it?

05:06.348 --> 05:08.850
That's not something
you can build in your free time!

05:08.850 --> 05:10.143
No way!

05:10.143 --> 05:11.353
Wow!

05:11.353 --> 05:12.687
A home?!

05:12.687 --> 05:14.356
I'm so jealous!

05:16.733 --> 05:18.944
- What do we do?
- Not sure.

05:18.944 --> 05:20.237
Isn't it obvious?

05:20.237 --> 05:21.154
But...

05:21.154 --> 05:22.989
Another girls meeting?

05:22.989 --> 05:25.283
By the way, how many people
can fit in your place?

05:25.283 --> 05:28.495
If 1.6 square meters can fit 6 people,
then maybe around 240 people?

05:28.495 --> 05:30.497
Wait, 240 people?

05:30.497 --> 05:32.666
Maybe more if I remove the furniture.

05:32.666 --> 05:34.042
Furniture?

05:34.042 --> 05:37.337
And if I count the kitchen,
toilet, and baths...

05:37.337 --> 05:38.672
You even have baths?

05:40.006 --> 05:42.801
How come you're living in luxury
on your own?!

05:43.593 --> 05:46.513
We're just barely scraping
by over here...

05:46.513 --> 05:49.234
I even made a separate guest room...

05:49.235 --> 05:50.976
But I should keep quiet about it.

05:52.786 --> 05:55.605
- Go for it, Class Rep!
- Do it!

05:56.857 --> 05:59.359
Umm, Haruka...

05:59.359 --> 06:02.237
It's hard to ask for this, but...

06:03.321 --> 06:07.116
Can we stay at your place,
just for today?

06:07.117 --> 06:08.827
What?!

06:08.827 --> 06:12.372
High school girls want to stay
overnight at my place?!

06:12.372 --> 06:15.250
Not to mention,
all the girls in my class?!

06:15.250 --> 06:17.377
We're staying over.

06:17.377 --> 06:21.506
Goodness, girls these days
are so scandalous...

06:21.506 --> 06:23.884
You're the one with scandalous thoughts!

06:30.807 --> 06:32.767
Oh, we'll make a left turn on that corner.

06:32.767 --> 06:36.104
What corner?
Why would there be a corner in a forest?

06:41.419 --> 06:43.838
Then take a right at this intersection.

06:43.839 --> 06:45.591
There's even an intersection?!

06:50.511 --> 06:52.763
Don't tell me you have
a convenience store?!

06:52.764 --> 06:54.789
I thought about making a pharmacy,
but I stopped.

06:55.236 --> 06:57.113
Good thing you did!

07:05.038 --> 07:06.957
He moved too fast...

07:07.726 --> 07:09.012
I'm tired...

07:09.012 --> 07:13.016
Welcome to my abode.
Thank you for coming all the way here.

07:15.567 --> 07:18.521
W-what is with this place?!

07:19.648 --> 07:22.038
- Seriously?!
- This is too awesome!

07:22.039 --> 07:23.526
Are we really still in another world?!

07:23.526 --> 07:24.985
No way!

07:24.986 --> 07:27.697
- This has to be a dream.
- It can't be real.

07:27.697 --> 07:30.241
I can't believe this is
in the middle of a forest!

07:30.241 --> 07:32.953
We can say goodbye
to living in tents!

07:33.495 --> 07:36.998
They're even more excited than the nerds.
I'm kinda embarrassed now.

07:36.998 --> 07:41.086
So, uh, the kitchen is that way.
The toilet is beyond there.

07:41.816 --> 07:43.213
While on that side is...

07:45.799 --> 07:48.927
H-hey! Listen to me first!

07:50.261 --> 07:53.765
It's the bathroom!

08:03.149 --> 08:05.110
Don't just strip out of nowhere!

08:05.110 --> 08:07.153
E-everyone, please!

08:10.973 --> 08:12.867
This is the best!

08:12.867 --> 08:14.327
It feels so good!

08:15.286 --> 08:17.122
So refreshing!

08:17.122 --> 08:18.707
I can't!

08:18.707 --> 08:23.086
Living too long in the forest has
turned their femininity into savagery!

08:24.504 --> 08:28.299
I'm finally alone!
I'm free and isolated!

08:28.299 --> 08:32.137
Only loners can understand
this happiness!

08:32.137 --> 08:35.515
I knew it, I can't stand
being around a bunch of girls.

08:37.338 --> 08:39.298
Whoa, Class Rep?!

08:40.812 --> 08:43.732
Haruka, I'm really thankful you helped us.

08:44.566 --> 08:49.195
After Oda and his friends left,
the other boys also left.

08:49.863 --> 08:51.823
It was a worrying situation for everyone.

08:54.219 --> 08:56.369
You really helped them calm down.

08:56.957 --> 08:58.830
So that's what happened.

08:58.830 --> 09:03.343
On top of that, they're feeling a lot better
thanks to the room, food, and baths.

09:03.344 --> 09:05.336
Girls sure rebound fast.

09:06.337 --> 09:11.009
Meanwhile, I couldn't help anyone
even though I'm the class rep.

09:11.718 --> 09:14.953
You did. You always do.

09:14.954 --> 09:17.390
Even today, you protected all the girls.

09:18.874 --> 09:22.711
But I didn't do much
compared to Oda and the others...

09:25.523 --> 09:27.358
That is all right.

09:27.358 --> 09:31.237
Those guys have already been preparing
to be summoned into a world like this.

09:32.238 --> 09:35.241
If anything, it's weirder
to be able to do what they did.

09:35.241 --> 09:39.079
T-that's a bit mean
to Oda and his friends...

09:39.079 --> 09:42.415
You can't use them
as the basis of reference.

09:42.415 --> 09:45.835
Don't compare yourself with those who
want to be transported to another world.

09:45.835 --> 09:48.004
Yeah, they're the weird ones.

09:51.596 --> 09:55.470
Thank you.
I feel a bit better now.

09:55.870 --> 09:57.997
You really are amazing, Haruka.

09:59.307 --> 10:04.145
But wait. You have a home, food,
and can defeat monsters.

10:04.145 --> 10:06.689
Aren't you weirder than Oda's group?

10:06.689 --> 10:10.693
Class Rep! So sharp, yet so sly!

10:11.818 --> 10:13.862
I'll be going, then.

10:13.863 --> 10:17.241
Thank you again for today.
Have a good night's rest.

10:17.242 --> 10:19.036
Yeah, good night.

10:24.415 --> 10:26.835
I'm sorry, Oda...

10:28.044 --> 10:30.171
Huggy...

10:43.226 --> 10:47.730
Sorry, Class rep.
I don't think I'll be getting any rest.

10:55.021 --> 10:56.689
Good morning...

10:58.074 --> 11:01.578
Breakfast is ready, please wake up.

11:02.579 --> 11:04.873
What's going on?

11:04.873 --> 11:06.749
Is this one of those things
a childhood friend

11:06.749 --> 11:08.877
or a cute little sister does?

11:09.377 --> 11:11.087
Nah, it's neither!

11:12.422 --> 11:13.298
Wait, who?!

11:15.842 --> 11:19.554
I still want to sleep, so can you
give me another thirty minutes...?

11:23.167 --> 11:25.852
Are you even really planning to get up?

11:25.852 --> 11:30.481
Y-you probably shouldn't say
something like that in this position...

11:31.608 --> 11:34.402
Uh, what's for breakfast?

11:34.402 --> 11:35.987
Mushroom and grilled fish.

11:36.696 --> 11:38.323
Fish?!

11:42.118 --> 11:44.287
A-are you all right?

11:53.087 --> 11:57.050
So good! It's been so long
since I've had any fish!

11:57.759 --> 12:01.262
Uh, must you really cry
just from eating that?

12:01.262 --> 12:03.556
You've been living near
a river, you know?

12:03.556 --> 12:05.141
I know!

12:05.141 --> 12:08.770
Every day I've been watching them
while eating mushrooms!

12:08.770 --> 12:10.647
Huh? Why aren't you catching them?

12:10.647 --> 12:14.297
I mean, they're so fast! And slippery!

12:14.298 --> 12:15.985
Why are you so girly about it?!

12:16.713 --> 12:20.865
Then do you have a way
to catch them?

12:24.179 --> 12:27.629
All right, I'll show you how to do it,
so pay attention!

12:27.630 --> 12:28.331
There!

12:33.253 --> 12:35.213
That's awesome.

12:35.213 --> 12:36.881
Do it again! One more time!

12:36.881 --> 12:37.840
Huh?

12:37.840 --> 12:39.300
Why?

12:39.300 --> 12:41.678
Come on, please!

12:41.678 --> 12:44.180
Fine, make sure you pay attention, okay?

12:47.725 --> 12:49.394
Excuse me for a bit.

12:52.397 --> 12:52.660
First, wrap the Lightning Magic
with my Packing skill...

12:52.660 --> 12:55.370
(Packing)
First, wrap the Lightning Magic
with my Packing skill...

13:02.031 --> 13:04.033
I got them!

13:04.033 --> 13:04.170
I even learned the Lightning Magic skill!

13:04.170 --> 13:07.010
(Lightning Magic Lv. 1)
I even learned the Lightning Magic skill!

13:07.010 --> 13:07.036
I even learned the Lightning Magic skill!

13:07.036 --> 13:10.290
Huh? What happened to my magic?

13:10.290 --> 13:12.959
Hey, Haruka, what did you do?

13:12.959 --> 13:15.545
(Packing: Pack up things using magic.)
I learned that Lightning Magic.

13:15.545 --> 13:17.750
(Packing: Pack up things using magic.)
By wrapping it with Packing skill,

13:17.750 --> 13:20.420
(Packing: Pack up things using magic.)
I can learn elemental magic...

13:20.425 --> 13:21.759
(Work on most things.)
Or so I think.

13:21.759 --> 13:23.820
(Work on most things.)
Wait, that's cheating!

13:23.845 --> 13:27.140
I guess that's the synergy between
my Packing and Master of None skill?

13:27.140 --> 13:30.101
Well, I guess even
worthless skills have their uses?

13:30.768 --> 13:34.856
It's super useful if you can
take magic just like that!

13:35.690 --> 13:39.861
No way, the skills I have
are just leftover bad ones.

13:39.861 --> 13:42.530
You guys took all the good ones.

13:42.530 --> 13:48.494
I mean, that lightning magic almost
made me pee my pants! It was crackling!

13:48.494 --> 13:49.787
Haruka?

13:53.666 --> 13:55.376
This feels so good!

13:55.376 --> 13:56.794
- Take that!
- Hey!

13:57.420 --> 14:00.882
So, have you decided
what you're gonna do from now on?

14:02.007 --> 14:04.301
It hasn't been decided,

14:04.302 --> 14:06.596
but we're thinking of heading
to the nearest town.

14:06.596 --> 14:08.014
Oh, okay.

14:08.014 --> 14:10.808
Right, the Gyarus are still
hunting down those nerds.

14:11.809 --> 14:14.830
Hey, I told you
we just want to say our thanks!

14:14.831 --> 14:16.230
Why would we hunt them?!

14:17.231 --> 14:20.943
We thought we should level up
before heading there.

14:20.943 --> 14:24.614
Right, you would need to raise your levels
if you want to hunt them.

14:24.989 --> 14:26.991
Why do you keep saying that?!

14:26.991 --> 14:28.951
- Listen to us already!
- Listen to us already!

14:28.951 --> 14:32.538
Well, if you want to level up,
then I'll help.

14:33.131 --> 14:35.249
Thank you, Haruka!

14:35.249 --> 14:37.835
But we're not hunting Oda
and his group, okay?

14:38.279 --> 14:39.379
Aww.

14:39.379 --> 14:43.591
I guess I won't get to see
the Nerds vs Gyarus cheat skill battle.

14:43.591 --> 14:46.094
Do it on a different show!

14:50.139 --> 14:54.685
Now then, before we grind some levels,
I need to know your current levels.

14:54.685 --> 14:56.687
I'm 19!

14:56.687 --> 14:57.855
17 here.

14:57.855 --> 14:59.148
Mine's 20.

14:59.148 --> 15:00.733
21.

15:00.733 --> 15:01.818
16, I think?

15:01.818 --> 15:04.779
The lowest is level 16?!
They're all so high up!

15:05.405 --> 15:07.907
Meanwhile I'm still at level 7...

15:07.907 --> 15:09.617
Come on, are we doing it?

15:09.617 --> 15:10.952
When are we starting?

15:10.952 --> 15:12.870
I'm getting tired here.

15:12.870 --> 15:14.122
So bored.

15:14.122 --> 15:15.289
Not yet?

15:15.289 --> 15:16.541
Boo.

15:16.541 --> 15:19.502
Do these cheat users even need me?

15:19.502 --> 15:21.379
Ah, perfect timing!

15:21.718 --> 15:23.381
Attention here!

15:23.881 --> 15:28.636
We'll start by having you
fight these kobolds!

15:30.221 --> 15:30.570
There are three of them, and their levels
aren't so high. Time for a fight!

15:30.570 --> 15:33.450
(Kobold A, Kobold B, Kobold C)
There are three of them, and their levels
aren't so high. Time for a fight!

15:34.976 --> 15:36.936
You're underestimating us, huh?

15:36.936 --> 15:39.772
We'll take care of them in a single spike.

15:39.772 --> 15:41.482
Good grief.

15:41.482 --> 15:42.900
Just you watch!

15:42.900 --> 15:45.570
All right, ready, go!

15:54.704 --> 15:56.622
You guys suck!

15:56.622 --> 15:58.624
Nobody told me they're going to bite!

15:58.624 --> 16:01.544
I didn't think they'd be that agile!

16:01.545 --> 16:02.670
What do we do?

16:02.670 --> 16:05.381
I don't want to fight them!

16:06.090 --> 16:09.552
I know my magic tent can expand,

16:09.552 --> 16:11.637
but what is everyone doing here?

16:12.346 --> 16:14.474
We're just reviewing what just happened.

16:14.474 --> 16:16.934
Why in my tent, though?

16:18.811 --> 16:21.314
- All right!
- We won't lose next time!

16:21.314 --> 16:22.815
Just you watch, kobolds!

16:22.815 --> 16:24.233
Prepare yourselves!

16:24.627 --> 16:26.879
It's finally over...

16:26.880 --> 16:29.758
It's good that they're motivated, but...

16:31.022 --> 16:32.392
Umm...

16:32.393 --> 16:34.437
Uh, umm...

16:34.438 --> 16:36.078
It's the girl from this morning.

16:38.586 --> 16:42.210
I'm sorry for this morning,
I was testing you.

16:43.002 --> 16:46.714
The boys in the class
once tried to assault me,

16:46.714 --> 16:48.508
and that traumatized me...

16:49.592 --> 16:54.138
I thought you might
have done the same thing...

16:55.014 --> 16:59.101
I see... The girls
went through such a thing...

16:59.101 --> 17:02.396
But you gave us food
and a place to stay,

17:02.396 --> 17:04.982
and even taught us how to fight.

17:04.982 --> 17:07.902
You're different from the other boys...

17:07.902 --> 17:10.947
I-I'll wake you up again
tomorrow, okay?

17:13.115 --> 17:14.825
Gotcha, Fish Girl.

17:14.825 --> 17:16.827
Why do you call me that?!

17:24.710 --> 17:27.588
Another delicious fish breakfast,
thanks to Fish Girl!

17:27.588 --> 17:30.161
Should we get a rematch
with those kobolds?

17:30.162 --> 17:31.634
Let's do it!

17:31.634 --> 17:34.720
They're going back at it
after that humiliating defeat?

17:34.720 --> 17:36.138
Somebody better stop them!

17:36.138 --> 17:38.391
All right, we'll get them even!

17:38.391 --> 17:40.017
Just you watch!

17:42.645 --> 17:44.939
Everyone, we need to train first!

17:44.939 --> 17:47.525
- Really...?
- Aww...

17:47.525 --> 17:49.860
Good job, Class Rep!

17:49.860 --> 17:52.113
And so, we begin our training.

17:52.113 --> 17:53.114
Go!

17:53.114 --> 17:55.150
Yes, Ma'am!

17:57.076 --> 17:57.340
Noo!

17:57.340 --> 17:58.077
(Gyaru Leader ran away)
Noo!

17:58.077 --> 17:58.840
(Gyaru Leader ran away)
I can't...

17:58.840 --> 17:59.370
I can't...

17:59.370 --> 18:00.600
I won't lose!

18:00.600 --> 18:00.871
(Deputy Class Rep C lost)

18:00.871 --> 18:01.100
(Deputy Class Rep C lost)
Class Rep, aren't you going
a little hard on them?

18:01.100 --> 18:01.600
(Volleyball Girl A lost)
Class Rep, aren't you going
a little hard on them?

18:01.600 --> 18:02.100
(Fish Girl lost)
Class Rep, aren't you going
a little hard on them?

18:02.100 --> 18:02.600
(Deputy Class Rep B lost)
Class Rep, aren't you going
a little hard on them?

18:02.600 --> 18:03.249
Class Rep, aren't you going
a little hard on them?

18:03.249 --> 18:04.625
And then...

18:06.909 --> 18:08.750
The day of the rematch finally came.

18:12.400 --> 18:12.592
(Snap)

18:12.592 --> 18:13.900
(Snap)
Snap.

18:13.900 --> 18:13.926
Snap.

18:13.926 --> 18:17.430
Oh boy, are they going to be all right?
Can they win?

18:18.764 --> 18:22.184
No more, I'm so sleepy...

18:23.269 --> 18:26.189
Hey, why are some taking a nap?!

18:26.190 --> 18:28.649
- My stomach hurts...
- Same here...

18:28.649 --> 18:29.567
What?!

18:29.817 --> 18:33.904
Some are even pretending to be sick!
This is no good!

18:33.904 --> 18:36.824
The whole training is a bust, Class Rep!

18:37.074 --> 18:38.951
Ah! Look out!

18:38.952 --> 18:41.329
I won't lose again!

18:42.152 --> 18:43.748
Nice blocking!

18:44.373 --> 18:46.876
I have to meet up with Oda,

18:47.363 --> 18:49.337
and apologize!

18:51.464 --> 18:53.716
Take this!

19:05.686 --> 19:06.937
All right!

19:06.937 --> 19:08.439
We won!

19:08.439 --> 19:11.609
We did it!

19:11.609 --> 19:13.694
That training paid off!

19:13.694 --> 19:15.613
Good job, everyone!

19:15.613 --> 19:20.126
Yay!

19:20.127 --> 19:22.159
You guys really had me worried.

19:22.160 --> 19:23.787
You actually can do it if you try.

19:27.221 --> 19:30.578
That was a good fight.
We won't lose our next encounter either.

19:32.363 --> 19:34.090
Suit yourself!

19:34.090 --> 19:35.216
We won!

19:35.216 --> 19:36.842
They're actually kinda cute.

19:36.842 --> 19:38.094
Can we keep them?

19:39.679 --> 19:43.974
That said, now I should be able
to go back to my free loner life...

19:43.974 --> 19:46.018
Thank you, Haruka.

19:46.018 --> 19:48.479
Now we can head to the town with you.

19:49.355 --> 19:52.983
Huh? I never said anything
about coming with you...

19:53.892 --> 19:55.418
You'll come with us, right?

20:00.746 --> 20:01.997
Everyone!

20:02.743 --> 20:04.453
Do we have our fish?

20:04.453 --> 20:05.830
Yes!

20:05.830 --> 20:07.289
Do we have our mushrooms?

20:07.289 --> 20:08.666
Yes!

20:08.666 --> 20:10.292
Hey, you can fit more.

20:11.252 --> 20:12.878
There's no way...

20:12.878 --> 20:15.172
Come on, you can.

20:15.172 --> 20:16.590
I said I can't.

20:16.590 --> 20:18.092
That bag is way too stuffed!

20:18.092 --> 20:20.594
This isn't some kind of bargain sale!

20:20.594 --> 20:23.431
Egh, fine. I guess I'll leave it behind.

20:24.515 --> 20:26.600
I have to stay behind and watch over?

20:26.600 --> 20:28.477
We're not leaving her behind!

20:30.723 --> 20:31.856
All right, then.

20:32.481 --> 20:35.025
Time to head off to the town!

20:35.025 --> 20:37.361
Yeah!

20:37.611 --> 20:38.863
I can't wait!

20:38.863 --> 20:40.614
Hope we can do laundry!

20:40.614 --> 20:41.949
I want to eat meat!

20:41.949 --> 20:44.910
Maybe we'll find some rare fish.

20:47.413 --> 20:48.706
Class Rep.

20:48.706 --> 20:50.291
What is it, Haruka?

20:53.133 --> 20:55.466
There's no telling
what's going to happen after this.

20:57.071 --> 20:58.896
Let's make sure
we're ready for everything.

21:26.160 --> 21:27.536
It hurts.

21:33.709 --> 21:36.837
N-not me! I don't have that skill!

21:36.837 --> 21:38.422
Please don't kill me!

21:45.095 --> 21:46.222
Stop...!

22:17.795 --> 22:22.383
♪The sunset I saw on my own was beautiful♪

22:22.383 --> 22:27.596
♪I ended the day
Without having anyone to talk about it♪

22:27.596 --> 22:32.226
♪I care not for the loneliness and moved on♪

22:32.226 --> 22:37.398
♪One thing after another
New stuff keeps appearing before me♪

22:37.398 --> 22:42.027
♪I went through so many things
Yet I can't imagine how it will go♪

22:42.027 --> 22:44.697
♪How silly I am♪

22:44.697 --> 22:49.326
♪They might look bland
Yet that's not always the case♪

22:49.326 --> 22:54.331
♪They toy with the careless me
Who still hasn't learned my lesson♪

22:54.331 --> 22:59.086
♪As always, we're all loners♪

22:59.086 --> 23:03.966
♪Each time we pass by
We say our hellos and goodbyes♪

23:03.966 --> 23:08.846
♪I care not
I simply want to play for today♪

23:08.846 --> 23:13.976
♪Having a little fun
Before saying good night♪

23:16.645 --> 23:22.943
♪I hum as I think of the next time
We meet again♪

23:26.405 --> 23:32.703
♪I hum on in the middle of
My lonely journey♪
